<title>RUSSIA: RUSSIA TO SEND 16MLN MT OF CRUDE VIA UKRAINE IN 97.</title>
<headline>RUSSIA TO SEND 16MLN MT OF CRUDE VIA UKRAINE IN 97.</headline>
<text>
<p>MOSCOW, Jan 9 (Platt's) - Russia is likely to transit 16 million mt crude oil exports to Europe thruogh Ukraine this year, the same volume as in 1996, Interfax reported Thursday, quoting the Ukrainian state oil and gas committee.</p>
<p>In 1996 Russia reluctantly agreed to pay Ukraine $5.2/mt for crude exported through its territory to Hungary, the Czech Republic and Serbia via the Druzhba pipeline.</p>
</text>
